#
# x86-64 coroutine context switching: saves and restores the callee-saved
# register set (RBX, RBP, R12-R15) and swaps RSP between two context slots.
# Selected automatically via the compiler's "native" arch token
# (uranite.os.arch.native.context).
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
